raw_text = "~ stage_8_1
brother : Here... the ‘sacrifice fish’. now your turn to cure my sister!
entity : i’m afraid I couldn’t do that
brother : what the ****, I did the things you told me to...
entity : .....
entity : your sister come here while you’re not here.
brother : my sister did? 
entity : she said she would offer her heart if I promised to not contact you anymore.
brother : that’s a bullshit.... promised is a promised.... you did that with me first....
entity : our contract wansn't real, my contract with her are pact with blood. 
entity : but.... you could override the contract by making a real one.... not only changing the contract but also remove her memory of the contract
brother : then do it!
entity : i would take your heart, changing it with the other heart i had. but there is gonna be some problem tought because it was an override contract
brother : I don’t care.. just do it...
=> END

~ stage_8_2
brother : huft... please... make it work...
=> END"
